            "created_at": "2025-07-06T00:33:23.259679+00:00",
            "notes": "For this round, we are going to build on the previous round by incorporating some blue items into the build. \n\nFirstly, [Vitality Amplifier](item_6b52b1c9-a924-4a93-8545-a1c205cf6927) is the first blue that you will need to purchase as it gives you extra shield, lifesteal and the best part is that you get 10% Ability Power when above 80% HP.\n\nThe second blue that you're going to want to get is [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) as this allows you to get bonus Lifesteal and Bonus Ability Power. \n\nYou should have enough to keep the three green items from the start, if you are maximising the Torpedoes and using them effectively. Sometimes you may end up with just not enough for all the items here so you can sell [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7) as you already have a good amount of Lifesteal from the blue items.",
