            "created_at": "2025-07-06T00:33:23.259679+00:00",
            "notes": "This round you are going to want to get the [Cosmic Coolant](item_5584169d-94af-4efa-955c-263353a75553) Power so that your Torpedoes can have faster uptime and can farm more money and heals/damage. This power reduces the cooldown by 0.5 seconds per individual target hit, which includes teammates. \n\nIn terms of items, you are going to want to get [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) as this allows you to get up to 25% Ability Power for 3 seconds after you have used your Mediblaster to deal Healing or Damage. This is basically free Ability Power to have more impactful Torpedoes. \n\nThe additional items include the blue and green items from the previous round as they create a well-rounded build for Round 3.",
