            "notes": "This is where is starts to get a bit more expensive each round, but this should be no trouble for you. \n\nIn this round, we want to purchase [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) if you have enough. This allows you to get the extra Amour as well as restoring that Armour when using Abilities.\n\nIf you can't afford the two purples and the three blues, you can swap out one of the blues for the greens that are in the Optional Section. These are still really good to use at this stage, but you should have enough if you are maximising the Torpedoes to their full potential and hitting multiple targets.",
