            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-06T00:33:23.259679+00:00",
            "notes": "For this rounds power, you get a choice between [Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) and [Medicinal Missiles](item_30eeab6c-4a1e-4a16-b9dd-e83d633caa40). \n\n[Hyper Healer](item_108336b3-54d2-4d69-8ea4-c2da5affb7ca) is the one that I usually go for as it is always going to provide value when engaging/disengaging from fights as it gives you the extra sustain.\n\nHowever, if you're team is taking a lot of damage and needs extra burst healing, I would definitely recommend [Medicinal Missiles](item_30eeab6c-4a1e-4a16-b9dd-e83d633caa40) instead as this will allow you and the other support to reset and heal the team up faster. This is especially useful if you have a feeding tank that is always Crit. \n\nThe item that you want to get this round is [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) for the boost in Ability Power and Healing Reduction.  \n\nAs mentioned before, it is better to have the purples and not the blue items, so if you can't afford all three purple items, sell a blue and purchase green with any leftover cash - every % of Lifesteal/Ability Power helps.",
