            "created_at": "2025-07-06T00:33:23.259679+00:00",
            "notes": "This round you can decide whether you want bonus damage with [Pulsar Destroyers](item_707ad8c7-a153-4140-b4bc-1f23f7d7a648) or the healing reduction on enemies with [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505).\n\nFor me, this is a very situational pick, as both are very strong in their own ways. If the the enemy team have a lot of healing and your team is finding it difficult to out-damage the healing, take [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) as the Healing Reduction really helps to push through the heals if you're hitting multiple enemies with the Torpedoes. \n\nIf you're managing to secure kills without worrying about healing, take [Pulsar Destroyers](item_707ad8c7-a153-4140-b4bc-1f23f7d7a648) as the bonus damage really helps too. \n\nYou want to keep the same blue items with the Lifesteal as these keep you alive and because the Torpedoes are doing so much damage, you will be getting a crazy amount of Lifesteal. However, you can sell [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) as you will have purchased a better purple item.",
